What does o.b return?

```js
const o = { a: 1 };
o.b = 2;
o.b;
```

What does this return?

```js
const o = { a: 1 };
o.a;
```

What is the return type of add?

```ts
function add(a: number, b: number): number {
  return a + b;
}
```

What is the return type of log?

```ts
function log(msg: string): void {
  console.log(msg);
}
```

What type is user.age?

```ts
const user: { name: string; age: number } = { name: "Sam", age: 5 };
user.age;
```

What type is dog.name?

```ts
interface Animal {
  name: string;
}
const dog: Animal = { name: "Rex" };
dog.name;
```

What is useDebugValue for?

```jsx
function useOnlineStatus() {
  const [isOnline, setIsOnline] = useState(true);

  // Shows "Online" or "Offline" in React DevTools
  useDebugValue(isOnline ? "Online" : "Offline");

  return isOnline;
}
```

