What does this code output?

```javascript
// running as a non-module browser script (top-level this is the global object)
const obj = {
  name: "Alice",
  greet: function() {
    return () => console.log(this.name);
  },
  farewell: () => {
    console.log(this.name);
  }
};
obj.greet()();
obj.farewell();
```

